WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.467 --> 00:00:04.671
-Hey, I'm Finn Wolfhard
and this is "Three Scoops."

00:00:04.671 --> 00:00:07.673
Okay. So there's a lot of
"Stranger Things" fan theories.

00:00:07.673 --> 00:00:10.176
Um, there's been a lot over the
years since the show came out.

00:00:10.176 --> 00:00:12.745
One weird one that I saw was,
like,

00:00:12.745 --> 00:00:14.313
it was like a "Wizard of Oz"
parallel

00:00:14.313 --> 00:00:16.349
it was like the Mind Flayer
is Dorothy.

00:00:16.349 --> 00:00:19.285
I don't know how people got
there, but respect it.

00:00:19.285 --> 00:00:22.288
My all-time favorite movie,
actually no, is "The Graduate."

00:00:22.288 --> 00:00:24.290
It's amazing.
It's a perfect movie.

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:25.791
I feel like this'll be
problematic.

00:00:25.791 --> 00:00:29.228
And I feel like I'll ruin my job
by saying these things.

00:00:29.228 --> 00:00:31.297
I hate fruit.
I hate all fruit.

00:00:31.297 --> 00:00:32.765
I know that's, like,
gonna seem like a, like,

00:00:32.765 --> 00:00:36.168
a cringy, like, quirky thing,
but I've always hated it.

00:00:36.168 --> 00:00:38.871
And I'm just, you know -- that's
just me being honest, baby.

00:00:38.871 --> 00:00:40.940
It's Finn Wolfhard
and that was "Three Scoops."

